                                "sense_id": "ce4ebec5-4234-3185-b0cd-9f51b3853303",
                                "text": "Il a attelé son cheval sur un cotteur.",
                                "translation": "He hitched his horse to a cutter.",
                                "english": "He hitched his horse to a cutter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ed27f97-61b4-4b0d-8c32-09dd1e992cbd",
                                "sense_id": "ce4ebec5-4234-3185-b0cd-9f51b3853303",
                                "text": "En tout cas, je sais que Schultz, il a été mis dans les brancards du cotteur, puis il a traîné sa femme au Fort.",
                                "translation": "Anyhow, I know that Schultz was put in the traces of the cutter, and he dragged his wife to the Fort.",
